{
  "_comment": "Single source of truth for the optional, service-specific questions on the request form and for the server's validation of them. Every question is a single radio group and always offers a Don't know / Not sure choice. Option ids are stable: they travel in the form post and appear in the notification email as their labels. The question wording is a proposal for Shane to approve; changing a label here changes it everywhere. An 'issue' question describes the problem; when one is answered with a real choice (not 'other' and not a don't-know / not-sure answer), the written description becomes optional (issueSatisfiesDescription). Set that flag to false to make the description required again.",
